{"ref":"passive:mini-impostor","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Impostor is a passive item from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Impostor is added to the level up item pool after ",{"t":"Sharp Tongue","r":"weapon:sharp-tongue"}," reaches level 2. It is consumed upon Sharp Tongue evolving into ",{"t":"Impostongue","r":"weapon:impostongue"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Impostor can be found as a stage item on ",{"t":"Polus Replica","r":"stage:polus-replica"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["C1_SHRINK_IMPOST"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Impostor?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["3"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Impostor?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Impostor?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Impostor?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[["Polus Replica"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Mini Impostor mirrors the effects of ",{"t":"Knife","r":"weapon:knife"},", acting as a lesser version of the weapon. It also spawns a miniature, non-functional ",{"t":"Impostor Rina","r":"character:impostor-rina"}," that flies around the player's character. Each Mini Imposter level corresponds to the same level for Knife."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once it is consumed after evolving Sharp Tongue, the Knife effect disappears, although th